ACTUALLY LIVE.

00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:44.252
IN AMERICA'S HOMELESS

00:01:44.253 --> 00:01:45.420
POPULATION IS HUGE AND

00:01:45.421 --> 00:01:46.221
GROWING ACCORDING TO THE

00:01:46.222 --> 00:01:47.589
GOVERNMENT EVEN AS THE

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:48.490
HOMELESS POPULATION RISES

